---
---
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="de">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Akropolis Aachen — Griechisches Restaurant</title>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Sora:wght@400;600;700;800&family=Outfit:wght@300;400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
    body { background: #0D0905; color: #F5F0E8; font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif; }
    .nav { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; padding: 20px 48px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(212,175,55,0.2); }
    .logo { font-family: 'Sora', sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 1.3rem; color: #D4AF37; letter-spacing: 0.05em; }
    .nav-links { display: flex; gap: 32px; list-style: none; }
    .nav-links a { color: #A0916E; text-decoration: none; font-size: 0.9rem; }
    .nav-links a:hover { color: #F5F0E8; }
    .btn { background: #D4AF37; color: #0D0905; padding: 10px 22px; border-radius: 8px; font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif; font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none; font-size: 0.9rem; }
    .hero { position: relative; padding: 120px 48px 100px; text-align: center; background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(212,175,55,0.05) 0%, transparent 60%); }
    .hero-badge { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; background: rgba(212,175,55,0.1); border: 1px solid rgba(212,175,55,0.3); border-radius: 100px; padding: 6px 16px; font-size: 0.75rem; color: #D4AF37; margin-bottom: 24px; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; }
    .hero h1 { font-family: 'Sora', sans-serif; font-size: 3.5rem; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.1; letter-spacing: -0.04em; margin-bottom: 20px; }
    .hero h1 span { color: #D4AF37; }
    .hero p { color: #A0916E; font-size: 1.1rem; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 40px; max-width: 560px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; }
    .hero-ctas { display: flex; gap: 16px; justify-content: center; }
    .btn-outline { border: 1px solid rgba(212,175,55,0.4); color: #D4AF37; padding: 10px 22px; border-radius: 8px; text-decoration: none; font-size: 0.9rem; }
    .stats-bar { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 0; border-top: 1px solid rgba(212,175,55,0.15); border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(212,175,55,0.15); }
    .stat { padding: 32px 48px; text-align: center; border-right: 1px solid rgba(212,175,55,0.15); }
    .stat:last-child { border-right: none; }
    .stat-val { font-family: 'Sora', sans-serif; font-size: 2.5rem; font-weight: 800; color: #D4AF37; }
    .stat-label { color: #A0916E; font-size: 0.85rem; margin-top: 6px; }
    .menu-section { padding: 80px 48px; max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto; }
    .menu-section h2 { font-family: 'Sora', sans-serif; font-size: 2.2rem; font-weight: 800; text-align: center; margin-bottom: 48px; }
    .menu-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 24px; }
    .menu-card { background: rgba(212,175,55,0.04); border: 1px solid rgba(212,175,55,0.15); border-radius: 12px; padding: 28px; }
    .menu-category { font-size: 0.7rem; color: #D4AF37; letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 12px; }
    .menu-item { padding: 12px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(212,175,55,0.08); display: flex; justify-content: space-between; }
    .menu-item:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
    .item-name { font-size: 0.9rem; font-weight: 500; }
    .item-price { color: #D4AF37; font-weight: 600; font-size: 0.9rem; }
    .cta-section { padding: 80px 48px; text-align: center; background: rgba(212,175,55,0.03); }
    .cta-section h2 { font-family: 'Sora', sans-serif; font-size: 2.5rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 16px; }
    .cta-section p { color: #A0916E; margin-bottom: 32px; }
    footer { border-top: 1px solid rgba(212,175,55,0.15); padding: 32px 48px; text-align: center; color: #64748B; font-size: 0.8rem; }
    footer a { color: #D4AF37; text-decoration: none; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <nav class="nav">
    <div class="logo">AKROPOLIS</div>
    <ul class="nav-links">
      <li><a href="#">Speisekarte</a></li>
      <li><a href="#">Reservierung</a></li>
      <li><a href="#">Über uns</a></li>
      <li><a href="#">Kontakt</a></li>
    </ul>
    <a href="#" class="btn">Tisch reservieren</a>
  </nav>

  <div class="hero">
    <div class="hero-badge">Griechische Küche · Aachen · Seit 1998</div>
    <h1>Authentisch griechisch.<br><span>Herz von Aachen.</span></h1>
    <p>Erlebe die Aromen Griechenlands mitten in Aachen. Frische Zutaten, traditionsreiche Rezepte und eine Atmosphäre, die dich direkt ans Mittelmeer versetzt.</p>
    <div class="hero-ctas">
      <a href="#" class="btn">Jetzt reservieren</a>
      <a href="#" class="btn-outline">Zur Speisekarte</a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="stats-bar">
    <div class="stat">
      <div class="stat-val">#1</div>
      <div class="stat-label">Griechisches Restaurant bei Google Aachen</div>
    </div>
    <div class="stat">
      <div class="stat-val">3×</div>
      <div class="stat-label">Mehr Reservierungen nach Website-Relaunch</div>
    </div>
    <div class="stat">
      <div class="stat-val">4.9★</div>
      <div class="stat-label">Google-Bewertung (200+ Reviews)</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="menu-section">
    <h2>Unsere Speisekarte</h2>
    <div class="menu-grid">
      <div class="menu-card">
        <div class="menu-category">Vorspeisen</div>
        <div class="menu-item"><span class="item-name">Tzatziki</span><span class="item-price">6,50 €</span></div>
        <div class="menu-item"><span class="item-name">Taramosalata</span><span class="item-price">7,50 €</span></div>
        <div class="menu-item"><span class="item-name">Spanakopita</span><span class="item-price">9,00 €</span></div>
        <div class="menu-item"><span class="item-name">Saganaki</span><span class="item-price">8,50 €</span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="menu-card">
        <div class="menu-category">Hauptgerichte</div>
        <div class="menu-item"><span class="item-name">Souvlaki (Schwein)</span><span class="item-price">16,50 €</span></div>
        <div class="menu-item"><span class="item-name">Moussakas</span><span class="item-price">17,50 €</span></div>
        <div class="menu-item"><span class="item-name">Lammkeule</span><span class="item-price">24,00 €</span></div>
        <div class="menu-item"><span class="item-name">Gegrillter Fisch</span><span class="item-price">22,00 €</span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="menu-card">
        <div class="menu-category">Desserts</div>
        <div class="menu-item"><span class="item-name">Baklava</span><span class="item-price">5,50 €</span></div>
        <div class="menu-item"><span class="item-name">Loukoumades</span><span class="item-price">6,00 €</span></div>
        <div class="menu-item"><span class="item-name">Galaktoboureko</span><span class="item-price">6,50 €</span></div>
        <div class="menu-item"><span class="item-name">Griechischer Kaffee</span><span class="item-price">3,50 €</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="cta-section">
    <h2>Bereit für Griechenland in Aachen?</h2>
    <p>Reserviere jetzt deinen Tisch — online, schnell, unverbindlich.</p>
    <a href="#" class="btn" style="font-size:1rem;padding:14px 28px;">Tisch online reservieren</a>
  </div>

  <footer>© 2024 Akropolis Aachen · Website von <a href="https://elevo.solutions">ELEVO Webagentur Aachen</a></footer>
</body>
</html>
